# 🤖 AI HR Recruitment Assistant

AI-powered recruitment assistant built using LangGraph 
multi-agent architecture.

## ✨ Features
- 📄 Resume parsing using AI
- 🎯 Job description matching  
- ⭐ Candidate scoring out of 100
- 🏆 Multiple resume comparison with ranking
- 📊 Visual score dashboard with Plotly charts
- 📥 Downloadable HR reports

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
Python | LangGraph | LangChain | Groq LLaMA 3.1 | Streamlit | Plotly

## 🚀 How to Run
1. Clone: git clone https://github.com/YourUsername/ai-hr-recruitment-assistant
2. Install: pip install -r requirements.txt
3. Add GROQ_API_KEY in .env file
4. Run: streamlit run app.py

## 🏗️ Architecture
5 AI Agents connected via LangGraph:
- Agent 1 → Resume Parser
- Agent 2 → Job Matcher
- Agent 3 → Candidate Scorer
- Agent 4 → Report Generator
- Agent 5 → Comparison & Ranking
